{%- comment -%}
  structured-data.liquid — Shopify-native Product & Article schema ONLY.

  Phase A dedup: removed the duplicate WebSite entity (canonical source is now
  snippets/tbk-schema-website.liquid) and the duplicate BreadcrumbList
  (canonical source is now snippets/tbk-schema-breadcrumb.liquid).
  This snippet is retained because it is the ONLY source of Shopify's native
  Product/Article structured data, which those two snippets do not provide.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if request.page_type == 'product' -%}
<script type="application/ld+json">{{ product | structured_data }}</script>
{%- elsif request.page_type == 'article' -%}
<script type="application/ld+json">{{ article | structured_data }}</script>
{%- endif -%}
